Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.02,0:01:34.53,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(613,436)\pos(192,875)}Episode 3: The Curse of DIO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a spider or a\Npiece of flesh. That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what made him\Nswear allegiance to Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a flesh bud\Nformed from Dio's cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It connects directly to the boy's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flesh buds are small.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they have the power to influence\Na person's thoughts and actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply put, that bud stirs him and awakens\Na certain feeling far beyond his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charisma! The sheer\Nemotive power that drives a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soldier to follow a dictator\Nor a believer to put
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his faith in a corrupt\Ncult this young man revered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio and that's why he\Nswore allegiance to him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio knows how to wield\Nthe power of charisma
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means there will\Nbe others he will try to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,influence he ordered this\Nyoung man here to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us and he won't stop until\Nhe has So remove the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the brain is very delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he even twitches while we extract\Nit, it could cause brain damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four months ago, while I\Nwas still there in Cairo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I encountered Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a fortune teller by trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a shop in a Seiko\Ncalled Khan el-Khalili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a full moon that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just stood at the top of the\Nstairs outside my shop, silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With eyes so cold, it felt\Nlike he was invading my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden hair and\Ntranslucent alabaster skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But most of all, a dubious sensuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind you wouldn't expect from a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar had warned me about\Nhim, I knew exactly who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, resurrected from the\Ndepths of the Atlantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you have a special ability\Nbeyond that of an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would please me if you'd\Ngrant me a small demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was then that I found\Nhim to be truly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every word he spoke calmed my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dangerous sweetness in his voice is\Nprecisely what makes him so terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, come here.
