Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ran for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't dare think of fighting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was very fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I had prior knowledge of Dio,\NI was able to realize who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I immediately jumped out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Seiko is a labyrinth, but I\Nknow it like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks to that, I was able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I would have\Nended up like this young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another follower\Ncontrolled by a flesh bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have died a few years later\Nwith your brain completely devoured. Died?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not jump the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin's not in great shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's not dead yet!
