Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pull it out with my Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jotaro, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, just back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can remove this thing\Nwithout damaging his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my stand has the precision to catch a\Nspeeding bullet, then it can also do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flesh blood is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of that flesh blood lives\Noutside his body for a reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a skilled surgeon can't\Nremove it without serious damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just sunk itself into his flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let go, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can infiltrate anyone's brain\Nwho dares try to remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would try not to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I mess this up, your brain is fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It already reached your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Abdul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandson is very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's made it halfway through his\Nbody, and yet he's still completely calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a tremble from\Neither him or his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can move with more precision and\Nstrength than I ever anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why did you risk\Nyour life to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really have an answer for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, I see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.14,0:07:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's Akemi, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.14,0:07:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to rest for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, go and get his futon ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even liked the idea\Nof sleeping on the damn floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, that futon in my room,\Nreplace it with a real bed. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in Japan now, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here in Japan, we sleep on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd prefer if you\Ncall me Seiko here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Japanese also have a word for Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, the word for it is Senaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's why all my\Nfriends call me Seiko here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holi's a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave it to you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't refer to me\Nas Seiko, I won't answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's the pain, Kakyoin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you out of that uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, take it off. Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear something? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave me Jotaro's pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the right size and\Nall, but I'm not wearing these!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm supposed to call her\NSeiko or she won't answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter has one name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, time for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is your goodbye kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's usually how my mornings play out.
