Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kujo, please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's burning up. Is she sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.36,0:10:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kujo, please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's transparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has a stand. Mrs.
