Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.47,0:10:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cujo has gained a stand as\Nwell. But this high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand is doing damage to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all so relieved that Dio's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had only affected Jojo and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar We were so certain Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cujo was fine. But that's just\Nwhat we wanted to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for her to escape that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as she has Joestar\Nblood in her veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.12,0:10:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will inevitably\Nbe an effect from Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, a stand is controlled by\Nan individual's own mental strength,?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they move according to that\Nperson's fighting instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cujo is a kind and peaceful woman who\Ndoesn't have the power to resist Dio's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have the strength\Nshe needs to control her stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be why her\Nstand is making her so ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's acting against her, not with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be overcome!
