Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one thing I feared most.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the very last thing\NI ever wanted to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter has developed\Nthe stand as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always known she's too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't withstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew if this day came\Nit would destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have the strength\Nneeded to repel Dio's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, to start we must find Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to break this curse\Nis to find Dio and kill him!
