Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding him is the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I try,\Nhe's always hiding in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In every spirit photo I take,\Nthe background is black.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to locate\Nhim with my photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've used various methods\Nto try and analyze them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with this darkness, we\Nalways come up with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you should have\Nmentioned this to me sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be able to find out\Nwhat's hiding in that darkness.
