Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our fly through all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how in the hell\Nis a fly going to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen this fly before. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have an encyclopedia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do have a library.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have the sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do some research.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, get some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm a little busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can your own stand really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have seen far too many people\Nsuffer exactly that same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, it's Limited\Nto her back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that stand will grow\Nlike a fiendish vine and it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't stop until Her whole\Nbody is overtaken and bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her fever will rise and\Nher illness will worsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:15:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll fall Into a coma and never wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your average person would see\Nthis as some Rare and unknown
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disease that no doctor in the\Nworld would be able to treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And normally neither you nor\NI could do anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there is still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will take 50 days for her\Nbody to reach that state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to find and\Ndefeat Dio before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can sever the link her stand\Nhas with Dio, we can save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was\Nthat came over me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I had a fever\Nand passed out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's on her\Nback, she can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has no idea what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you gave us quite a scare, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that you're up, why\Ndon't you brush your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say ah. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.98,0:16:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let's get that face clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll tidy up your hair while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's take care of those nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, will you help me change\Nmy underwear, too? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want for dinner, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just stay in bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just meant you should stay put,\Nat least until your fever breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be quiet and get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.06,0:16:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kinda like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so nice when I get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a little cold isn't\Nso bad from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:16:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She lost consciousness again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was acting fine, but this\Nfever is so bad, it spiked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was just putting on a good front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she didn't say anything, but my\Ndaughter is definitely aware of her stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was doing her best just now to try
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hide it from us. My guess is that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she didn't want us to worry about her
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my daughter's always been like that mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar I found it I know where that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fly is From it's this one the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tsetse fly a blood-sucking insect\Nprevalent in the Nile river basin the tetsi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,genus includes a striped species known\Nas the aswan tetsi fly Egypt and we've
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.06,0:17:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,narrowed it down to the aswan region\NDio is there so he is in Egypt after all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin what do you mean by that the flesh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bud was planted into my\Nbrain three months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's when i met Dio\Ni was on a trip with my
