Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were in Egypt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems for some reason, Dio\Nwants to remain in that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, when are we leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'll be going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be completely honest, I have\Nno idea why I want to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just something I\Nfeel compelled to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just say that you open my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly, we're going to\Nsave you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are going to make\Nyou better, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take it easy and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo's mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holly, has the ability to calm a person's\Nsoul and put their minds at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People feel relaxed\Njust by being near her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may sound strange,\Nbut if I ever fall in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd want it to be with someone like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd feel the need to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to see her\Nfeeling better and smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're doctors from the\NSpeedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to stay with her and\Ntake care of Holly around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I am a fortune teller by trade,\NI'd like to name your stand before we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the tarot, the cards of fate, do not\Nlook, but let chance guide your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will not only suggest to us your destiny,\Nbut also the abilities of your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Star Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall name your stand Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo, stand name Star Platinum.
